{
    "title": "Real Coaster: Idle Game",
    "description": "Do you have what it takes to run the biggest and most fun idle theme park empire in the world? Grow and manage amazing idle theme parks and become the richest theme park tycoon!\r\n\r\nBuild the coolest attractions, hire employees, be the boss. Will you focus on investing in the roller coasters first and have fun riding them? Or will you invest in infrastructure and become filthy rich? Be the best idle tycoon and grow your idle theme park empire at your own pace in this idle planet coaster experience.\r\n\r\nBuild giant roller coasters, stunning ferries wheels, cool water slides and many other rides for your amusement park. Manage the biggest idle theme park empire in the world while having fun riding all rides in first person yourself.\r\n\r\nIf you are a fan of idle games and planet coaster, you will love Real Coaster: Idle Game. Easy to play gameplay with challenging tasks and missions. Starting with one small amusement park, make decisive management decisions to grow an entire idle theme park empire. Become the richest theme park tycoon in the world.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\nBUILD - your own idle theme park. Easy and fun idle gameplay for every player. \r\nHAVE FUN - Ride your roller coasters and attractions in first person\r\nBE AMAZED \u2013 Enjoy awesome 3D graphics and simulations in your own amusement park\r\nINVEST - Grow your theme parks portfolio from Gold Rush park Nevada to Cyber Park Tokyo\r\nCOLLECT - Earn enough money to build and decorate your ultimate fun park empire\r\nEXPAND \u2013 Decide which investment tasks to complete to grow your amusement park fast and keep your visitors happy\r\nIMPROVE \u2013 Upgrade the rides and facilities in your idle theme park empire\r\nSHARE \u2013 Capture videos of the coolest rides and share them with your friends\r\nENJOY \u2013 day and nighttime simulation and on-line back-up of game progress\r\nMANAGE \u2013 your queues and parking lots to keep the visitors of your amusement park happy\r\nCLAIM \u2013 your rewards to grow your idle theme park even faster\r\nGROW \u2013 your empire and build the best amusement park in history\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n\r\nTo begin with, manage your first small idle theme park. Decide where to invest to grow your amusement park as you wish. This awesome idle game gives you the opportunity to make your idle theme park an amazing place where all visitors have fun riding roller coasters, drop towers, the ferries wheel and many more super thrilling attractions known from games like planet coaster and rollercoaster tycoon.\r\n\r\nAnd the best part \u2013 you can 3D sim ride all the attractions yourself in first person (POV).\r\n\r\nInstall shops and upgrade your entrance and parking lots to earn more money. Then invest to expand your amusement park. You can even expand to multiple locations and become the biggest idle theme park manager out there.\r\n\r\nImprove your park with brand new roller coasters and attractions to bring even more visitors to your amusement park. \r\n\r\nManage queue times at the entrance and at the rides to keep you visitors happy. Hire Staff to operate the ticket booths to maximize the income of the theme park and to collect positive feedback. Earn enough money in this top idle tycoon game to open multiple idle theme parks and expand your empire. \r\n\r\nDownload the Real Coaster: Idle Game now and have fun!\r\n\r\nWant to keep up to date with the game?\r\n\r\nFollow us on:\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/realcoaster/\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/realcoaster_idlegame/\r\n\r\nQuestions about the game? Contact our support at support@raventurn.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you have what it takes to run the biggest and most fun idle theme park empire in the world? Grow and manage amazing idle theme parks and become the richest theme park tycoon!<br><br>Build the coolest attractions, hire employees, be the boss. Will you focus on investing in the roller coasters first and have fun riding them? Or will you invest in infrastructure and become filthy rich? Be the best idle tycoon and grow your idle theme park empire at your own pace in this idle planet coaster experience.<br><br>Build giant roller coasters, stunning ferries wheels, cool water slides and many other rides for your amusement park. Manage the biggest idle theme park empire in the world while having fun riding all rides in first person yourself.<br><br>If you are a fan of idle games and planet coaster, you will love Real Coaster: Idle Game. Easy to play gameplay with challenging tasks and missions. Starting with one small amusement park, make decisive management decisions to grow an entire idle theme park empire. Become the richest theme park tycoon in the world.<br><br>FEATURES:<br><br>BUILD - your own idle theme park. Easy and fun idle gameplay for every player. <br>HAVE FUN - Ride your roller coasters and attractions in first person<br>BE AMAZED \u2013 Enjoy awesome 3D graphics and simulations in your own amusement park<br>INVEST - Grow your theme parks portfolio from Gold Rush park Nevada to Cyber Park Tokyo<br>COLLECT - Earn enough money to build and decorate your ultimate fun park empire<br>EXPAND \u2013 Decide which investment tasks to complete to grow your amusement park fast and keep your visitors happy<br>IMPROVE \u2013 Upgrade the rides and facilities in your idle theme park empire<br>SHARE \u2013 Capture videos of the coolest rides and share them with your friends<br>ENJOY \u2013 day and nighttime simulation and on-line back-up of game progress<br>MANAGE \u2013 your queues and parking lots to keep the visitors of your amusement park happy<br>CLAIM \u2013 your rewards to grow your idle theme park even faster<br>GROW \u2013 your empire and build the best amusement park in history<br><br>HOW TO PLAY:<br><br>To begin with, manage your first small idle theme park. Decide where to invest to grow your amusement park as you wish. This awesome idle game gives you the opportunity to make your idle theme park an amazing place where all visitors have fun riding roller coasters, drop towers, the ferries wheel and many more super thrilling attractions known from games like planet coaster and rollercoaster tycoon.<br><br>And the best part \u2013 you can 3D sim ride all the attractions yourself in first person (POV).<br><br>Install shops and upgrade your entrance and parking lots to earn more money. Then invest to expand your amusement park. You can even expand to multiple locations and become the biggest idle theme park manager out there.<br><br>Improve your park with brand new roller coasters and attractions to bring even more visitors to your amusement park. <br><br>Manage queue times at the entrance and at the rides to keep you visitors happy. Hire Staff to operate the ticket booths to maximize the income of the theme park and to collect positive feedback. Earn enough money in this top idle tycoon game to open multiple idle theme parks and expand your empire. <br><br>Download the Real Coaster: Idle Game now and have fun!<br><br>Want to keep up to date with the game?<br><br>Follow us on:<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/realcoaster/<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/realcoaster_idlegame/<br><br>Questions about the game? Contact our support at support@raventurn.com",
